      "options": {
        "content": "# Docker Logs (Dozzle) & Additional Resources\n\n## Log Viewer\nView detailed Docker container logs at [Dozzle](http://localhost:8801)\n\nDozzle provides:\n- Real-time log streaming\n- Search and filter capabilities\n- Multi-container log view\n- Log persistence\n\n## Service-Specific Dashboards\n- **Scrapy & PostgresML**: View the dedicated monitoring dashboard for web scraping and ML features\n- **Scrapy UI**: http://localhost:3007 (when running)\n- **PostgresML Dashboard**: http://localhost:8100\n\n## Container Monitoring\nThis dashboard shows:\n- CPU and memory usage for all containers\n- Container restart statistics\n- Complete container inventory\n- Real-time health status\n\nClick the Dozzle link above to view detailed logs.",
